---
// FeaturesSection.astro - Structured grid of features with clean typography
---

<section id="features" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-border-subtle">
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-10">
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted mb-2">
        CORE CAPABILITIES
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink leading-tight">
        Engineered for speed, context, and complete control.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
        Everything you need to produce thoughtful commentary and grow your social presence, without the bloat of conventional SaaS plugins.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Features Grid with Structured Borders -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1: Context Engine -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">01 / CONTEXT</span>
            <span>DOM-Aware</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Native Thread Context
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            Replyly observes the DOM structure of X and LinkedIn in real time, inspecting the parent post text, author, and thread history so responses sound genuinely relevant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Active targets: x.com, linkedin.com
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Multi-Model Freedom -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">02 / PROVIDERS</span>
            <span>Multi-LLM</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Your Choice of Model
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            Switch effortlessly between Google Gemini (Gemini 2.5 Flash), Groq (Llama 3.3 70B for instant under 200ms generation), and OpenRouter (Claude 3.5, GPT-4o, DeepSeek).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Latency: ~180ms – 450ms
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Tone Presets -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">03 / VOICE</span>
            <span>Presets</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Tone Preset Engine
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            Toggle between Professional, Casual, and Witty tones in a single click, or define your own custom persona guidelines in the extension options.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Custom system prompts supported
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: One-Click Insertion -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">04 / WORKFLOW</span>
            <span>Instant</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Direct Reply Box Insertion
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            No copying and pasting across tabs. The generated reply pastes cleanly into the active feed composer, leaving you in total editorial control before sending.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Zero friction composer integration
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Local-First Storage -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">05 / PRIVACY</span>
            <span>Local-Only</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Zero Tracking or Telemetry
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            Your API keys are stored in encrypted `chrome.storage.local`. They never leave your device except over direct HTTPS connections to the AI API endpoint you selected.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Zero third-party cookies or scripts
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: Modern Manifest V3 -->
      <div class="border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-border transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider">06 / PERFORMANCE</span>
            <span>MV3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink mb-2">
            Lightweight & Future-Proof
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
            Built using the Plasmo framework with strict Chrome Manifest V3 compliance. Negligible RAM footprint, zero background drain, and instant startup.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
          Compatible: Chrome, Brave, Arc, Edge
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
